      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chiang_Mai"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Chiang Mai’s historic center is a walled city, and its old‑town streets close to motorised traffic on Sundays for the famous Sunday Night Market.",
